  "title": "IMPERIAL PETROLEUM INC. ANNOUNCES THE DATE FOR THE RELEASE OF THE FIRST QUARTER 2026 FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS, CONFERENCE CALL AND WEBCAST",
  "summary": "ATHENS, GREECE MAY 19, 2026 . Imperial Petroleum Inc. is a ship-owning company providing petroleum products, crude oil and drybulk seaborne transportation services, announced today that it will release its first quarter financial and operating results for the period ended March 31, 2026 before the market opens in New York on May 22, 2026. On May 22, 2026 at 10:00 am ET, the company’s management will host a conference call to discuss the results and the company’s operations and outlook.",
